        <dictScrap type="liebermann"><hi rend="bold">ofgan</hi> <hi rend="bold">1</hi>) <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:absolutus"><abbr>abs.</abbr></ref></hi> mid lufe ~ <hi rend="italic">durch Versöhnung erlangen (Ziel: Freundschaft von beleidigter Sippe)</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wer">Wer</ref> 6,1; procedere <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Quadr">Q</ref> [<hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:silbenhaft"><abbr>silbenhaft</abbr></ref> <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:missverstanden"><abbr>missverst.</abbr></ref></hi>] <hi rend="bold">2</hi>) <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Optativ"><abbr>op</abbr></ref></hi> 3: ofga <hi rend="italic">eine Klage giltig anhebe und so die Reinigung des Beklagten erzwinge</hi> [<hi rend="italic">wobei</hi> mid foreaðe <hi rend="italic">‘<ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:durch"><abbr>durch</abbr></ref> Klageid’ das Mittel angibt</hi>]; <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Object"><abbr>Objekt</abbr></ref> ist:</hi> <hi rend="bold">a</hi>) <hi rend="italic">die Klage:</hi> tihtlan <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 23,2; spæce <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 22,2. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 6,2 <hi rend="bold">b</hi>) <hi rend="italic">der Gegenbeweis:</hi> lade (ordal) <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 22,1a. (30,3a) | inducere, prosequi <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:ubersetzt"><abbr>übs</abbr></ref>.</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Quadr">Q</ref>; attingere Cons; con-(ad)quirere <ref type="lawCode" target="law:InCn">In Cn</ref>; præiuret II 22,2 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Quadr">Q</ref>; iuret <ref type="lawCode" target="law:InCn">In</ref> | <hi rend="italic">zu</hi> 30,3a <ref type="lawCode" target="law:InCn">In</ref> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:setzt"><abbr>setzt</abbr></ref></hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:H">H</ref> <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:als"><abbr>als</abbr></ref> synonym:</hi> ofræce þæt ordel | <hi rend="italic">ebendorther schöpft missverständlich</hi> eant ad iudicium, quod Angli ‘ofgan þæt ordel’ dicunt <ref type="lawCode" target="law:PsCnFor">Ps Cn for</ref> 11</dictScrap>
